   function is not coverage. Watch for silent regressions: paths that used to
   throw or return an error and now return null or empty.
3. Independently scan for behavioral-contract drift (error strings, validation,
   sort order, weakened return types), concurrency bugs, resource leaks,
   auth gaps, input reaching queries or shell commands or file paths
